        "testNames": [
          "repeated subscribe/unsubscribe — simulating a component re-rendering on every streamed token — never re-probes or resets the success streak",
          "unsubscribing the last listener pauses the loop — no more probes once it is scheduled",
          "resubscribing after a pause resumes polling",
          "rapid unsubscribe/resubscribe cycles never trigger more than one check per initial interval",
          "an in-flight check resolving after the last listener unsubscribed does not revive the loop",
          "resubscribing while a probe from before the pause is pending adopts it instead of starting another",
          "a probe that settles while paused becomes the next subscriber’s snapshot, without emitting"
